      "text": "MST edges (green): 2-3 (12), 0-1 (20), 1-2 (30); MST weight = 62 <= OPT\nFull walk 0-1-2-3-2-1-0 costs 2 x 62 = 124\nShortcutting repeated cities (triangle inequality) gives tour 0-1-2-3-0 = 97 <= 124",
